# Applies to dev AND production. Next only reads .env.production for a
# production build, so a value that lives only there leaves `next dev` with the
# licence check disabled and the unlock page correctly saying so — which reads
# as a bug and is not one. One service, one URL, one file.
# The unlock service. A public origin, not a secret — the endpoint's protection
# is the licence key, not obscurity of its address. Inlined into the static
# export at build time, so a change here needs a rebuild and redeploy.
#
# Cloud Run, project eight-domains-practice-test, region us-central1.
NEXT_PUBLIC_UNLOCK_URL=https://unlock-218361507293.us-central1.run.app
